    "body": "Yes, this code represents that spec text. Breaking it down: CSR[misa].H == 1 guards that hstatus/VTW exists, then CSR[mstatus].TW == 1'b0 checks \"TW is clear\", CSR[hstatus].VTW == 1'b1 checks \"VTW is set\", and mode() == VS || VU checks the privilege mode matching all the conditions in the spec passage. The misa.H guard follows the same pattern as WFI. Is there a specific part that looks off?",
